color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=1877F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&amp;label=instagram&amp;logo=instagram&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&amp;label=tiktok&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>💡 关于此附加内容 💡<br></strong></span></h2><p>Emissivity 附加内容为 Aether 模组中的各种物品、方块和装备应用了<strong>发光纹理</strong>。这意味着无论光照条件如何，这些纹理在游戏中都会显得明亮。</p><p>这些变化适用于由<strong>Ambrosium、凤凰装备、地牢石符文，甚至是斥力盾</strong>制成的物品。所有物品和方块的发光纹理都通过模组的数据包文件处理，而发光装备则可以通过模组的配置选项进行切换。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/emissivity0.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"402\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 更多来自 The Aether 团队 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>如果您对此附加内容有疑问，或者对 The Aether 团队开发的其他项目感兴趣，您可以加入 The Aether 项目的 Discord！我们友好的工作人员和热情的社区将确保您在这里感到宾至如归！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>您还可以通过 Patreon 支持 The Aether 团队！每一笔支持都将直接用于开发，使我们能够继续做我们最热爱的事情。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
